<%# locals: (event:) %>

<p>
  <%= event.name %> is on the <strong><%= event.plan.label %></strong> plan.

  <%# FUIME-DIVERGENCE: "fee waiver" linked to a Hack Club blog post announcing
      HCB's hackathon-grant programme — not Fuime's, and not something a Fuime
      operator can act on. Unlinked rather than repointed: there is no Fuime
      equivalent to point at, and a dead "#" href is worse than plain text.

      The plan and its expiry date are left as they are. This branch only renders
      for Event::Plan::HighSchoolHackathon, an upstream plan no Fuime venture is
      on, so rewriting the sentence would be inventing copy for a state that
      cannot occur (CLAUDE.md Rule 2 — disable, don't delete). %>
  <% if event.plan.is_a?(Event::Plan::HighSchoolHackathon) %>
    The <strong>fee waiver expires</strong> December 31st, 2024.
  <% end %>
</p>
